OL,3,GNEWSAThe best of Cornwall honoured at
OL,4,Aawards ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hedgehog hospital, a LGBT history
OL,7,Fproject and a community martial arts
OL,8,Fgym in Bodmin have all been celebrated
OL,9,Fat a special ceremony in Cornwall.
OL,11,FThe winners of the BBC Radio Cornwall
OL,12,FMake a Difference Awards 2026 were
OL,13,Fannounced in Truro on Wednesday.
OL,15,FThe awards, which are in their fifth
OL,16,Fyear, recognise and celebrate the
OL,17,Funsung people and groups who make a
OL,18,Fdifference in their communities across
OL,19,Fthe county.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
