OL,3,GNEWSAThe best of Cornwall honoured at
OL,4,Aawards ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FManaging editor of BBC Radio Cornwall
OL,7,FEmma Clements thanked everyone
OL,8,Finvolved, adding: "I think that
OL,9,Feveryone who was nominated should feel
OL,10,Fvery proud and be celebrated for the
OL,11,Fwork they do."
